      <section data-research-page="view"><h2>2 · 样本筛选与脑图</h2><div class="research-form"><label>指标<select id="rMetric"></select></label><label>组别<select id="rGroup"></select></label><label>动物<select id="rSample"></select></label><label>时间点<select id="rTime"></select></label><label>半球<select id="rHemisphere"><option value="B">双侧汇总 B</option><option value="L">左侧 L</option><option value="R">右侧 R</option></select></label></div><div class="research-actions"><button id="rApply" class="button primary">将筛选结果均值应用到脑图</button><button id="rExportRows" class="button secondary">导出筛选后的动物级数值</button></div><p>同一脑区每只动物仅贡献一个值；存在多个时间点时请先选择单个时间点。单位不一致时不会自动合并。切换脑图不会删除原始长表。</p><div id="rDataTable" class="research-table"></div></section>
